  "details": "After opening VRChat i am able to play anywhere from 5 minutes to roughly an hour before my computer locks up and the game crashes. I get a pop up saying my video card timed out.  My specs are Ryzen 7 5800X CPUR, AMD RX7900 XTX, with 32GB of ram. I have reinstalled drivers, verified file integrity, reinstalled the game. Other VR games run fine. Other PC Games run fine. VRChat seems to have this crashing issue after the mid March update.",
